# Keycloak token requests (dev only — Direct Access Grants / password grant).
# Works in IntelliJ's HTTP client. Realm setup: infra/keycloak/README.md.

### Get a token for alice (customer) — decode access_token at https://jwt.io,
### expect realm_access.roles to contain "customer".
POST http://localhost:8081/realms/ticketly/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id=ticketly-api&username=alice&password=password

### Get a token for bob (organizer)
POST http://localhost:8081/realms/ticketly/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id=ticketly-api&username=bob&password=password

### OIDC discovery document — issuer, JWKS URI, endpoints. The services'
### resource-server config (F-06) points at this issuer.
GET http://localhost:8081/realms/ticketly/.well-known/openid-configuration